+    // Some X86 IO devices fail to call makeAtomicResponse() in their
+    // timing path, delivering a request packet here instead of a response.
+    // Convert it so trySendTiming() can send it without asserting.
+    // makeResponse() asserts isRequest() && needsResponse() — guard both.
+    // Packets that are neither convertible nor responses are discarded.
+    if (!pkt->isResponse()) {
